SUMMARY:10 Year Anniversary Party!!!
DESCRIPTION:It’s hard to believe we opened our doors 10 years ago! So much has changed\, and we’ve definitely been through a lot along the way. Through all the ups and downs\, we’re incredibly grateful for everyone who has supported us and been part of the journey \nCome spend the day with us at Mad Co. Brew & Pizza as we celebrate 10 YEARS!\nEnjoy: Beer specials Pizza Live music all day Anniversary merch And so much more!\n TRENT RASH | 3:00–5:30 PMTrent brings a little bit of country and a little bit of rock ’n’ roll—something for everyone!\n DAN TRULL | 6:00–9:00 PMHailing from the Chicagoland area\, Dan toured in the late ’90s with alternative band 10 Daze Late. With more than 800 original songs in his music library\, he truly has something for everyone!\nExpect high energy\, great storytelling\, and plenty of crowd interaction—audience participation is a must at his shows!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/10-year-anniversary-party/
LOCATION:Mad Co. Brew House Marshall
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Madison County
END:VEVENT
